Ev4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"aEl6kgpPPXaaFK8UvFz4pw","review_id":"qQBMruEhH4wV7nPLQroZwA","date":"2017-10-22T19:49:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9510810375213623,"text_excerpt":"I'll used to avoid Juan's on Magazine in the LGD because although I've always appreciated their punk rock approach to Tex Mex, it always seemed like there was a wait when I wanted to eat there and the food just wasn't worth it (or, rather, their vegan versions of their food wasn't worth it). When I heard that 1. they've added a spicy tofu option to their burritos, tacos and salads and 2. they were opening up in the former Slice Uptown location, I knew I had to give them another try and I am so effin' glad I did because last night's visit might have made me a devout Juan's fan. I lived across from this location about 6 years ago and I seemed to always be at Slice because it ain't bad pizza..."},{"business_id":"aEl6kgpPPXaaFK8UvFz4pw","review_id":"84sLLJeybCF2DoyNvAmw4A","date":"2019-06-10T19:57:58","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9488612413406372,"text_excerpt":"This Juan's may be my favorite location (Mid-City is close). The staff is so great. The drinks are good and the food is solid. There's not much more you could ask for. My new favorite thing is that marvelous bacon bean dip. The last time I went I was with a group of friends on Taco Tuesday and we got the quatro, which is guacamole, salsa, queso, and the bacon bean dip. It was covered in bacon. I couldn't even see the beans at first. All of the dips were good but I kept going back to that bean dip. For my drink, I had a frozen lemon berry margarita (lunazel reposado, strawberry lemonade, and lime). It was so tasty and refreshing AND you can order it by the pitcher if you want. For my entre..."},{"business_id":"aEl6kgpPPXaaFK8UvFz4pw","review_id":"yuax18WgOcveCKt81y1cyA","date":"2019-01-11T22:30:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9482850432395935,"text_excerpt":"First time at this Juan's location and I think I prefer it over the others. There's way less traffic, more parking, and it's a better place to just go to have a casual dinner. We got seated immediately when we got there which was great. I ordered the Juan's Tacos with chicken. They were sooo filling which was perfect because I was starving by the time I got there. Our food came out really quick. Our server was great with answering any questions and getting us what we needed. I definitely want to go try out their happy hour one of these days!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"aEl6kgpPPXaaFK8UvFz4pw","photo_id":"JhB34Bg-FFe3wWMhePNtDA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/JhB34Bg-FFe3wWMhePNtDA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9579291939735413},{"business_id":"aEl6kgpPPXaaFK8UvFz4pw","photo_id":"8I8P9oOWKLBSFJOOE6rG9Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/8I8P9oOWKLBSFJOOE6rG9Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9454219937324524},{"business_id":"aEl6kgpPPXaaFK8UvFz4pw","photo_id":"0qYDJhHsfCS68Uo5MLw4pQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/0qYDJhHsfCS68Uo5MLw4pQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9255702495574951},{"business_id":"aEl6kgpPPXaaFK8UvFz4pw","photo_id":"QRsdeeB0fE5mMRbsx2wgkQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QRsdeeB0fE5mMRbsx2wgkQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8959360122680664},{"business_id":"aEl6kgpPPXaaFK8UvFz4pw","photo_id":"_TPlJ7dNQ-pW4FofRUCMOA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_TPlJ7dNQ-pW4FofRUCMOA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.868835985660553}]},"notebook_case":null}
